    "description":  "A Daedric quest in which the player hears rumors of Jarl Balgruuf\u0027s troubled son Nelkir, discovers the Whispering Door in Dragonsreach\u0027s basement, speaks with Mephala the Lady of Whispers, obtains the key, and retrieves the Ebony Blade.",
